# Deals Module

> Core acquisition pipeline for managing mineral purchase opportunities from initial prospect to completed acquisition.

---

# Overview

The Deals module is the operational heart of Oil & Gas OS. It manages the complete lifecycle of every mineral acquisition opportunity, allowing acquisition teams to track progress, collaborate across departments, and maintain a complete audit trail from first contact through closing.

Each Deal represents a potential acquisition linked to one or more mineral owners, assets, campaigns, and supporting documents.

---

# Objectives

The Deals module enables users to:

- Track acquisition opportunities
- Manage Purchase & Sale Agreements (PSAs)
- Monitor due diligence progress
- Coordinate title review and curative work
- Assign ownership and responsibilities
- Record communication history
- Prepare transactions for closing
- Provide a complete audit trail

---

# Features

## Deal Pipeline

Every deal progresses through a standardized acquisition workflow.

Pipeline Stages

- Prospecting
- Mailer Sent
- Negotiating
- PSA Sent
- Due Diligence
- Closing
- Closed
- Dead

Each stage reflects the operational status of the acquisition and drives downstream workflows.

